// chapel of Saint-Ivo, Brother Aubin, the drowned monks, the crypt and the Bell, Josse Ferlan in the ditch, the master's
// last trace, the side quests of Ida (II_ida) and of little Ninon (IIC_ninon), and the gift of the Bell to the Order.
